// Section view with several planes (Onshape's Section view dialog: Exclude / Include, Section
// planes, Items to exclude; the offset arrow and the rotation arc; hatched caps), on the drawing
// bracket (`samples::drawing_bracket`: a 120 × 80 × 12 plate with four holes and an upright on
// the Front plane with a Ø24 hole).
// 01 the dialog: the Exclude and Include tabs, Section planes and Items to exclude; 02 the Front
//    plane picked: the front half removed, the caps hatched.
// 03 the Right plane picked too: only the wedge past both planes goes (a corner of the bracket
//    cut out), each cap stopping at the other plane; the Right plane is the active one (its
//    offset arrow and rotation arc).
// 04 Angle 25: the Right plane turned about its axis, the arc's readout "25 deg".
// 05 Offset 20 on it; 06 the Front plane's row clicked: the gizmo moves to it.
// 07 the Include tab: Items to include (none: everything is still cut).
// 08 the Front plane's ✕: one plane left, the Right plane turned 25°; 09 ✓: the section stays.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("drawing-bracket"),
        Key("F"),
        Click(ui("view-section")),
        WaitFor("section-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-section-dialog"),
        Click(ui("feature-front")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        ExpectText("section-planes", "Front plane"),
        Screenshot("02-front-plane-hatched"),
        Click(ui("feature-right")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        ExpectText("section-planes", "Right plane"),
        Screenshot("03-two-planes-wedge"),
        Click(ui("section-angle-field")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("25"),
        Key("Enter"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        ExpectText("section-angle-label", "25 deg"),
        Screenshot("04-right-plane-turned-25"),
        Click(ui("section-offset-field")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("20"),
        Key("Enter"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-offset-20"),
        Click(ui("section-planes-item-0")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-front-plane-active"),
        Click(ui("section-mode-1")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-include-tab"),
        Click(ui("section-mode-0")),
        Click(ui("section-planes-item-0-remove")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-one-plane-left"),
        Click(ui("section-dialog-accept")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-accepted"),
    ],
)
